{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg3NweRpzLALVMo81xZNb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The merge is resolved and committed as `d595acc`. Every test suite passes, but `npm run size` still fails on the core bundle. That overage comes from the base branch, not from this merge.\n\n**Conflicts resolved:**\n1. `src/htm.ts`: in a component's extra attributes, the base branch had added boolean attribute handling (`true` gives an empty attribute, `false` and `null` are dropped). This branch had added the attribute name check. I kept the base's handling and put the name check in front of it, so a bad name is skipped before anything is written. `compProps[k] = v` is enough now because the base's `_val` already unwraps `_Escaped`.\n2. `test/ssr.ts` and `test/index.ts`: I kept both sides' tests. That meant the attribute name tests, plus the void-element, cross-copy and parity-table tests from the base. In `test/ssr.ts` one `})` had to be added back, because both sides had shared the closing brace. No test names are duplicated.\n\n**Size limits:**\n- **Browser templater:** the name check makes it 20 B bigger, which put it 18 B over its limit. Using the spec's rule (measured size rounded up to the next 0.05 kB), I raised the limit in `.size-limit.js` from 4.8 kB to 4.85 kB against a measured 4.82 kB, and noted why in the comment there.\n- **Core (`microtags`):** it is 4.24 kB against a 4.2 kB limit, 42 B over. I didn't change this limit, because core's source and limit are identical to the base branch, so the base fails this check too. It needs fixing on the base branch, either by trimming core or by raising the limit there.\n\n**Results:** lint, build and typecheck passed in the `npm run gate` run, which then stopped at the core size check. I ran the remaining suites one by one and all of them pass: browser 380, SSR 112, build 39, plugins 13, CLI 23, hydration 114 + 17, hydration-dev 17. I deleted `example-hydration/build` afterwards."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":555,"cache_read_input_tokens":63210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":555},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8dac8c5-cdb5-4d79-8426-34bef63f506b","uuid":"fa88e973-4a58-4c1f-8d74-a36e325fdb64","timestamp":"2026-10-15T04:18:56.495Z","request_id":"req_011Cg3Nwe9hpREx7DP22huPc"}
